%% posix-on-wasm.mgp - POSIX on WebAssembly (or: what is an OS anyway?)
%% A gucOS talk (todos/0221): what an OS does, the DO / DON'T / DON'T
%% NEED TO split, and similar projects. Uses only directives the 0119
%% port renders (the 0202 whitelist).
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "#301848", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

POSIX on WebAssembly

or: what is an OS anyway?

%center
%size 3, fore "gray70"
space / click: next page    b: back    q: quit
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

What is an OS anyway?

	hardware abstraction (HAL)
	scheduling - who runs, and when
	memory management
	file system access
	inter-process communication
	device and I/O management
	protection and isolation
	a user interface - shell or desktop
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

What is POSIX?

	Portable Operating System Interface
	system-call C-library API
	shell and command-line utilities
	process, file and I/O model
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

gucOS

%area 28 60 5 32
%size 6, center, fore "SpringGreen"
DO
%size 5, left, fore "white", vgap 32
processes
sound
compositor
file system
shell
isolation
signals

%area 28 60 36 32
%size 6, center, fore "gold"
DON'T
%size 5, left, fore "white", vgap 32
threads
atomics
fork / exec
preemption

%area 28 60 67 32
%size 6, center, fore "orange"
DON'T NEED TO
%size 5, left, fore "white", vgap 32
SMP
drivers
scheduler
disk FS
MMU
boot
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Similar projects

	emscripten - single process
	emulators - emulate a whole x86 / ARM cpu,
		so expensive
	wasix / browsix - pay for fork / exec
		to get full POSIX
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 3, fore "gray70", center

(q quits)
